{"id":"vod_jy_38138","vodId":"38138","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠改 魔人布欧篇","name_cn":"龙珠改 魔人布欧篇","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第61集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/5a5a76e2f8b0aa27f2c2dec653ab35e7.jpg"},"summary":"经历了惊心动魄的沙鲁之战，Z战士更新换代。地球在孙悟饭（野泽雅子暂无内容配音）和朋友们的守护下，迎来了七年漫长而又短暂的和平岁月。已变成俊朗青年的每天往返于学校，在此期间结识了撒旦的女儿比迪丽。伴随着全世界的呐喊，阔别已久的天下第一武道大会宣布再度召开。悟饭、比迪丽、18号悟天、特兰克斯甚至从另一个世界告假而来的孙悟空等Z战士高调参加比赛，令坐享其成的撒旦战栗不已。而在赛场上，两名奇怪选手的加盟则拉开了地球新一轮危机的帷幕。在此之后，来自外太空的邪恶魔法师巴菲迪登场，他利用邪恶手段复活了被界王神封印的恐怖对手魔人布欧（盐屋浩三暂无内容配音）。Z战士的最恶之战，地球危在旦夕……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-11-30 14:25:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":61,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJQ7YJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdR158Ob/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3wKYOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmyM79b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7ax17o3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN055Da/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY5llMb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7XWWya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg2QQ3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqZMMGd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dB6RQNd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg27kYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN05ppa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3wKOxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg2Q63d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7ax178qb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.